OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder after
OL,4,Awoman's death
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Ffollowing the death of woman, police
OL,8,Fhave said.
OL,10,FLuke Rigby, 38, of Newcomen Road,
OL,11,FDartmouth, Devon is due to appear
OL,12,Fbefore Plymouth Magistrates' Court on
OL,13,FSaturday accused of the murder of
OL,14,F46-year-old Rebecca Grass.
OL,16,FPolice and paramedics were called after
OL,17,Freports of a serious disturbance at a
OL,18,Fproperty in Newcomen Road, Dartmouth,
OL,19,Fat about 21:20 BST on Tuesday, 6
OL,20,FOctober. Police said Grass died at the
OL,21,Fscene.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
