OL,5,
OL,6,FA 46-year-old man was also taken to
OL,7,Fhospital with facial injuries. Rigby
OL,8,Fhas been charged with assault
OL,9,Foccasioning grievous bodily harm in
OL,10,Frelation to the injured man, Devon and
OL,11,FCornwall Police said.
